<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Aroma issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Aroma issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aroma Liquor Holdings Ltd said on Monday that negotiations were in progress which, if successfully concluded, could have an effect on the price at which Aroma shares trade.</p>
<p>Aroma therefore advised shareholders to exercise caution when dealing in shares until a further announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
